可能，因为她们没有月经。但她们还是在追求上天的恩宠带来的奇迹。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "reviewId": "17408780_805ohCd3d", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1747027093, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22485614", "format": "epub", "version": 91216313, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/YueWen_22485614/s_YueWen_22485614.jpg", "title": "1Q84 BOOK 2（7月-9月）", "author": "[日]村上春树", "translator": "施小炜", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "第9章 青豆 作为恩宠的代价送来的东西", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_803SN55I7", "review": {"bookId": "22485614", "content": "终于提到了1984", "bookVersion": 85174280, "range": "14885-14982", "abstract": "“完全正确。在法律意义上，在现世意义上，呃，当然不是犯罪。但如果引用乔治·奥威尔的伟大经典，或者说是作为伟大出处的小说，这恰恰是接近‘思想犯罪’的东西。今年正巧又是一九八四年。也许是机缘巧合吧。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_803SN55I7", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1746941442, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22485614", "format": "epub", "version": 91216313, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/YueWen_22485614/s_YueWen_22485614.jpg", "title": "1Q84 BOOK 2（7月-9月）", "author": "[日]村上春树", "translator": "施小炜", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "第6章 天吾 我们拥有很长很长的手臂", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7ZUXHWnFD", "review": {"bookId": "22485614", "content": "一般人是绝没有这个勇气的，即使关闭了保险，也不敢把枪口指向自己的脑袋。", "bookVersion": 85174280, "range": "10148-10169", "abstract": "青豆把枪口贴在太阳穴上，有一种钢铁的冰凉。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7ZUXHWnFD", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1746434744, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22485614", "format": "epub", "version": 91216313, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/YueWen_22485614/s_YueWen_22485614.jpg", "title": "1Q84 BOOK 2（7月-9月）", "author": "[日]村上春树", "translator": "施小炜", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第3章 青豆 无法选择如何出生，但可以选择如何死", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 0}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7ZUXpNyB6", "review": {"bookId": "22485614", "content": "可以枪想像成一个随时会扎到人的针头，那样小心的拿在手上。", "bookVersion": 85174280, "range": "7838-7994", "abstract": "“除非有紧急情况，在摆弄、交接、运送枪支时，原则上枪膛里不能有一粒子弹。而且，你只要一看见枪支，原则上就该认为它是装好子弹的，直到你弄清的确没装为止。枪制造出来，就是为了杀人伤人的。你怎么小心都不为过。也许会有人嘲笑我这么说是太谨慎了。但真会发生无谓的事故，因此丧命或受重伤的家伙，总是那些嘲笑别人太谨慎的人。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7ZUXpNyB6", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1746434476, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22485614", "format": "epub", "version": 91216313, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/YueWen_22485614/s_YueWen_22485614.jpg", "title": "1Q84 BOOK 2（7月-9月）", "author": "[日]村上春树", "translator": "施小炜", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第3章 青豆 无法选择如何出生，但可以选择如何死", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 13}}